; Class-level strings of the ChronoCOM script package. The game looks up a
; localized variable in <package>.int under [<class name>], as the game's own
; DLC packages do (DLC_2.int), so these do not belong in XComGame.int.

; Flyover on a pod member the squad can see, on the turn its pod starts to
; fall back, hold or assault
[X2PodCoordinator_Optimized]
FallBackFlyover="Falling Back"
HoldFlyover="Holding Position"
AssaultFlyover="Assaulting"

; Flyover on the soldier the hive's fire is focused on, when it is chosen
[X2ChronoFirePlan]
HuntedFlyover="Hunted"

; Retired squad items (X2Item_ChronoSupport) and the EMP jam (X2Ability_ChronoSupport)
[X2Ability_ChronoSupport]
JammedName="Jammed"
JammedDesc="Cut off from the hive: this alien cannot be told where the squad is, and what it sees does not reach the others."

